| feature | threshold | left rows | right rows | conditional entropy | gain | split information | ratio | selected |
| ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | :--- |
| 0 | 0.5 | 1 | 3 | 0.688722 | 0.311278 | 0.811278 | 0.383689 | false |
| 0 | 1.5 | 2 | 2 | 0.000000 | 1.000000 | 1.000000 | 1.000000 | true |
| 0 | 2.5 | 3 | 1 | 0.688722 | 0.311278 | 0.811278 | 0.383689 | false |
| 1 | 0.5 | 1 | 3 | 0.688722 | 0.311278 | 0.811278 | 0.383689 | false |
| 1 | 1.5 | 2 | 2 | 0.000000 | 1.000000 | 1.000000 | 1.000000 | false |
